1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:06,625
For many seniors, remembering complicated passwords or typing verification codes is frustrating.

2
00:00:06,575 --> 00:00:11,437
With PNCC Care, seniors never have to type in a single password.

3
00:00:11,437 --> 00:00:15,975
When they open the app for the first time, they see a clean camera scanner.

4
00:00:15,975 --> 00:00:23,600
The adult child simply opens their own app, shows a secure family QR code, and points the parent's phone camera at it.

5
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,575
With a quick beep, the two phones are paired in under a second.

6
00:00:27,575 --> 00:00:34,262
The parent is immediately brought right to their daily home screen—just like scanning a barcode at the grocery store.

